			["Back north from the glaive (Druids: south along the road from {area:442}) to the {area:448}, where {npc:11218} sleeps beside Arbal. Take his quest: it gives you the {item:13536}. Use the horn to wake him and lead him south along the road to his bag at the southern edge of {zone:1439}; blow it again whenever he falls asleep. Then go on to {npc:11219} at {area:413}.\
Careful: Scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road."] = "Back north from the glaive (Druids: south along the road from Auberdine) to the Grove of the Ancients, where Kerlonian sleeps beside Arbal. Take his quest: it gives you the Horn of Awakening. Use the horn to wake him and lead him south along the road to his bag at the southern edge of Darkshore; blow it again whenever he falls asleep. Then go on to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post.\nCareful: Scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road.",
