			["Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the {area:1025}."] = "Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the Green Belt.",
			["North-west from {npc:1244}: Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks on the way, and almost every one drops flint. Black, Crimson and Monstrous Oozes fill {area:309}, just west of the road to {area:205} and north of Einar's camp. Any ooze there may hold {npc:2111}'s bag."] = "North-west from Rethiel: Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks on the way, and almost every one drops flint. Black, Crimson and Monstrous Oozes fill Ironbeard's Tomb, just west of the road to Dun Modr and north of Einar's camp. Any ooze there may hold Sida's bag.",
			["{item:4371}, for Look to the Stars in {area:42}: {npc:5175}, beside {npc:4081}, sometimes has one"] = "Bronze Tube, for Look to the Stars in Darkshire: Gearcutter Cogspinner, beside Lomac, sometimes has one",
