Careful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help."] = "Melizza is held in the centaur camp west of the graveyard. Free her and keep her alive on the walk out; she stops by the graveyard.\nCareful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help.",
			["{npc:5638}, if 30-40/02 didn't take it: the wreck lies below {npc:11863}'s tower"] = "Kreldig Ungor, if 30-40/02 didn't take it: the wreck lies below Azore's tower",
			["{npc:6019} stands at the edge of the {area:596}, south-west of {area:2407}; {object:176751} lie among the skeletons."] = "Hornizz stands at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard, south-west of Kormek's Hut; Kodo Bones lie among the skeletons.",
		},
		zone = 1443,
		zoneName = "Desolace",
	}
end)

