			["Ride west out of {area:976} to the long ramp down into {zone:1449}. {npc:9619} camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "Ride west out of Gadgetzan to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater.",
			["The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of {npc:9619}. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for {npc:8737}. Any beast in the crater may drop {item:11116}: right-click it."] = "The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of Torwa. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for Linken. Any beast in the crater may drop A Mangled Journal: right-click it.",
