Careful: Venomhide Ravasaurs (50-51) hunt along the water there: pull them one at a time before you loot the carcass.\
Any ravasaur may drop a {item:280459}: right-click it, {npc:9619} takes it."] = "The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of Torwa.\nCareful: Venomhide Ravasaurs (50-51) hunt along the water there: pull them one at a time before you loot the carcass.\nAny ravasaur may drop a Crystal Infused Scale: right-click it, Torwa takes it.",
		},
		zone = 1449,
		zoneName = "Un'Goro Crater",
	}
end)

