Careful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot."] = "Cross the river east to the Undercroft, the crypt in the south-west of the zone. The Torn Scroll lies inside: its key is on Infiltrator Hameya in the far north-east, done in the next guide.\nCareful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot.",
