{npc:9997}'s friend {npc:9999} has gone missing."] = "Fly from Gadgetzan to Marshal's Refuge. Linken stands at the back of the refuge; J.D. Collie is in the cave behind him.\nSpraggle's friend Ringo has gone missing.",
			["From Theramore, ride west into the {zone:1413} and north up the coast to {area:392}."] = "From Theramore, ride west into the Barrens and north up the coast to Ratchet.",
			["Lead {npc:7774} back to {npc:7765} at walking pace: she wanders off, so ring the bell to call her back (not in combat), and clear the harpies on the way before she reaches them."] = "Lead Shay back to Rockbiter at walking pace: she wanders off, so ring the bell to call her back (not in combat), and clear the harpies on the way before she reaches them.",
			["Ride east to the border river: {npc:1855} lives in a small hut on the bank."] = "Ride east to the border river: Tirion lives in a small hut on the bank.",
			["Ride north to {area:2627}. {npc:12384} lives in the ruined hut, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby.\
Careful: the Frenzied Plaguehounds north-east of the hut are 57-58, a level or two over you: pull them one at a time."] = "Ride north to Terrordale. Augustus lives in the ruined hut, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby.\nCareful: the Frenzied Plaguehounds north-east of the hut are 57-58, a level or two over you: pull them one at a time.",
			["Ride north up the road to the Northridge lumber mill; {npc:11610} hides at the camp's edge."] = "Ride north up the road to the Northridge lumber mill; Kirsta hides at the camp's edge.",
			["Ride west into the Ravenwind Ruins: {npc:7774} hides in the small round building at the back. Open the chest beside her for {item:9189}: it lasts 15 minutes, like the quest."] = "Ride west into the Ravenwind Ruins: Shay hides in the small round building at the back. Open the chest beside her for Shay's Bell: it lasts 15 minutes, like the quest.",
			["Take the boat to the mainland and ride north-east past the {area:1119} to {npc:7775}'s camp. He brews the {item:11243} from an {item:11242}: take his errand for one."] = "Take the boat to the mainland and ride north-east past the Twin Colossals to Gregan's camp. He brews the Videre Elixir from an Evoroot: take his errand for one.",
			["The cauldron sits at the {area:202}, by {npc:10739}' farm."] = "The cauldron sits at the Writhing Haunt, by Mulgris' farm.",
			["The giant {npc:7765} sits just north-west of {npc:7775}'s camp."] = "The giant Rockbiter sits just north-west of Gregan's camp.",
			["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. {npc:9166} circle the slopes around it: they count for {npc:9997}."] = "The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. Pterrordax circle the slopes around it: they count for Spraggle.",
			["The tortured druids and sentinels haunt the ruined village south-west of {npc:13220}."] = "The tortured druids and sentinels haunt the ruined village south-west of Layo.",
			["The {item:280417} is a short ride west of {npc:9619}'s camp."] = "The Damaged Blue Crystal is a short ride west of Torwa's camp.",
			["{area:202} cauldron"] = "Writhing Haunt cauldron",
			["{item:12954} lies in the town hall of {area:190}, west of {npc:1855}: the Scarlet guards stand close together."] = "Davil's Libram lies in the town hall of Hearthglen, west of Tirion: the Scarlet guards stand close together.",
			["{npc:10927}'s farmhouse stands on the hill east of the camp; {npc:10936}'s monument is just north of it."] = "Marlene's farmhouse stands on the hill east of the camp; Joseph Redpath's monument is just north of it.",
			["{npc:11610}'s next task, {npc:11613} and {npc:11611}, waits for the {zone:1451} guide's Plaguelands leg: take it then."] = "Kirsta's next task, Huntsman Radley and Cavalier Durgen, waits for the Silithus guide's Plaguelands leg: take it then.",
			["{npc:15189}'s and {npc:15191}'s next tasks (the Stonelash scorpids and the Dredge Crushers) wait for the {zone:1451} guide's {area:3425} stop: take them then."] = "Beetix's and Windcaller Proudhorn's next tasks (the Stonelash scorpids and the Dredge Crushers) wait for the Silithus guide's Cenarion Hold stop: take them then.",
			["{npc:9619} camps at the foot of the ramp into the crater."] = "Torwa camps at the foot of the ramp into the crater.",
			["{npc:9684}'s lair lies in the jungle north of {npc:9619}, below the eastern cliffs: use {item:11568} there. {npc:9684} is level 56: start at full health."] = "Lar'korwi's lair lies in the jungle north of Torwa, below the eastern cliffs: use Torwa's Pouch there. Lar'korwi is level 56: start at full health.",
		},
		zone = 1422,
		zoneName = "Western Plaguelands",
	}
end)

