							races = { "Human" },
						},
						t = "note",
						text = "Near {area:87} there are no cats: Prowlers (wolves, level 9-10) roam eastern Elwynn, Longsnouts (boars, 10-11) its far south-west by the {zone:1436} border; at 12-13, Young Goretusks (boars) graze the fields of northern {zone:1436}.",
