			["{npc:256507}'s quest is open to Human and Gnome mages too, if you ever visit {area:16638} on {zone:2521}, the Skyborne home: {npc:252373}, the town's mage trainer, sends you to {npc:256507} next door, who wants a {item:262668} from the ground by the Windstone Formations south of {area:16636}, for the {item:263430}. It does not shut out the staff or the orb."] = "Belann's quest is open to Human and Gnome mages too, if you ever visit Valanaar on Zephras Isle, the Skyborne home: Anathamaas Aetherwind, the town's mage trainer, sends you to Belann Windwood next door, who wants a Wind-Infused Bough from the ground by the Windstone Formations south of Falaath Village, for the Windbough Wand. It does not shut out the staff or the orb.",
