			["Back up to the {object:32386}: {npc:6178} takes the script, {npc:6179} teaches you {spell:7328}."] = "Back up to the Hall of Mysteries: Muiredon takes the script, Tiza teaches you Redemption.",
			["Back upstairs in the {object:32386}. {npc:6179} gives you the {item:6866}; her husband {npc:6178} rests on the same floor. Keep the symbol: you need it on {npc:6177}. If you lose it, {npc:6179} gives you another (The {item:6866})."] = "Back upstairs in the Hall of Mysteries. Tiza gives you the Symbol of Life; her husband Muiredon Battleforge rests on the same floor. Keep the symbol: you need it on Narm Faulk. If you lose it, Tiza gives you another (The Symbol of Life).",
			["The Defias Rogue Wizards around the big stone tablet east of {npc:6172} carry the {item:6846}: about one kill in two drops it, but some players need many kills. They respawn in three minutes."] = "The Defias Rogue Wizards around the big stone tablet east of Henze carry the Defias Script: about one kill in two drops it, but some players need many kills. They respawn in three minutes.",
			["{npc:6171} stands inside the Cathedral of Light. He hands you the {quest:2998}: right-click it in your bags to start the next quest. If the book says the quest is already done, destroy it and ask {npc:6171} for a new copy. Bring 10 {item:2589} for the next step if you have it."] = "Duthorian Rall stands inside the Cathedral of Light. He hands you the Tome of Divinity: right-click it in your bags to start the next quest. If the book says the quest is already done, destroy it and ask Duthorian for a new copy. Bring 10 Linen Cloth for the next step if you have it.",
			["{npc:6179} stands upstairs in the {object:32386}, in the {object:32362}: take the ramp at the back of the hall. She hands you the {quest:2997}: right-click it in your bags to start the next quest. If the book says the quest is already done, destroy it and ask {npc:6179} for a new copy. Bring 10 {item:2589} for the next step if you have it."] = "Tiza Battleforge stands upstairs in the Hall of Mysteries, in the Mystic Ward: take the ramp at the back of the hall. She hands you the Tome of Divinity: right-click it in your bags to start the next quest. If the book says the quest is already done, destroy it and ask Tiza for a new copy. Bring 10 Linen Cloth for the next step if you have it.",
		},
		zone = 1453,
		zoneName = "Stormwind City",
