		why = "At 20: the succubus and Forever's incubus, its male twin, each with a soul pouch for your shards.",
		written = {
			["Back to {npc:6122} with the {quest:1738}. He hands you the {item:6913}: take the stairs behind him down to the crypt; part way along the lowest corridor a side stair on the left leads to the room with the purple circle. Stand on it and use the core. Summon your voidwalker first and keep the succubus (level 20, not elite) on the circle, or the guards may kill her and the kill does not count. If she wins, use the core again; keep it, {npc:6122} takes it back."] = "Back to Gakin with the Heartswood. He hands you the Heartswood Core: take the stairs behind him down to the crypt; part way along the lowest corridor a side stair on the left leads to the room with the purple circle. Stand on it and use the core. Summon your voidwalker first and keep the succubus (level 20, not elite) on the circle, or the guards may kill her and the kill does not count. If she wins, use the core again; keep it, Gakin takes it back.",
			["Give Gakin the figurine, then use the {item:190309} at the middle of the same circle and defeat the incubus it calls (level 20, not elite; it can charm you) with your voidwalker tanking. Keep the figurine: {npc:6122} takes it back."] = "Give Gakin the figurine, then use the Wooden Figurine at the middle of the same circle and defeat the incubus it calls (level 20, not elite; it can charm you) with your voidwalker tanking. Keep the figurine: Gakin takes it back.",
			["Ordil'Aran lies in north-west {zone:1440}, north of {area:415} along the road toward {zone:1439}. About twenty Dark Strand cultists hold the ruins around the great tree: keep to the outer wall, and click the {quest:1738} from as far away as it lets you. It is turned in to {npc:6122}, not to Takar."] = "Ordil'Aran lies in north-west Ashenvale, north of Astranaar along the road toward Darkshore. About twenty Dark Strand cultists hold the ruins around the great tree: keep to the outer wall, and click the Heartswood from as far away as it lets you. It is turned in to Gakin, not to Takar.",
		},
		zone = 1453,
		zoneName = "Stormwind City",
	}
end)

