		why = "Starts now at 20 with a shield; a hauberk at 28, then a coif, leggings and gauntlets from three smiths.",
		written = {
			["You have one hour, and {npc:6166}'s {spell:8553} leaves you drunk for 8-10 minutes. Run north-west into the {area:98}, keeping close to the cliff wall to miss most gnoll packs, and go in as far as the first fork; then come back to {npc:6166} (from the ridge you can jump down into {area:69}). Dying and releasing your spirit fails the quest: abandon it and {npc:6166} gives it again."] = "You have one hour, and Yorus's Barleybrew Scalder leaves you drunk for 8-10 minutes. Run north-west into the Rethban Caverns, keeping close to the cliff wall to miss most gnoll packs, and go in as far as the first fork; then come back to Yorus (from the ridge you can jump down into Lakeshire). Dying and releasing your spirit fails the quest: abandon it and Yorus gives it again.",
			["{npc:1416} keeps the weapon shop in the north-west of the {object:28027}, a short walk from {npc:5413}. He wants 20 {quest:1705} and the {item:6845}."] = "Grimand Elmore keeps the weapon shop in the north-west of the Dwarven District, a short walk from Furen. He wants 20 Burning Blood and the Burning Rock.",
			["{npc:5413} works in the Dwarven District of Stormwind. He takes the {item:6843} (lost it? abandon the quest and {npc:6166} gives a new one) and gives you {item:6970}, a shield."] = "Furen Longbeard works in the Dwarven District of Stormwind. He takes the Cask of Scalder (lost it? abandon the quest and Yorus gives a new one) and gives you Furen's Favor, a shield.",
			["{npc:5413}'s next task, {quest:1701}, is a level 28 quest: its chimaeras and Roogug are level 28, so the guide waits for level 27 before you take it. Come back to {npc:5413} in the {object:28027} then; {item:6842} list what it needs."] = "Furen's next task, Fire Hardened Mail, is a level 28 quest: its chimaeras and Roogug are level 28, so the guide waits for level 27 before you take it. Come back to Furen in the Dwarven District then; Furen's Instructions list what it needs.",
		},
		zone = 1433,
		zoneName = "Redridge Mountains",
	}
end)

