			["{quest:7812}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Dwarf or Night Elf stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Gnomes start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). {npc:9616}'s and {npc:9561}'s quests above take 8 turn-ins off; each {zone:1426} hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off. Outside Dun Morogh Gnomeregan pays little: {npc:4077}'s quests in Stonetalon (about 500) and {object:171524}'s {area:133} dungeon quests. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "Additional Runecloth: 50 reputation for 20 Runecloth, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Dwarf or Night Elf stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 Runecloth (Gnomes start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). Laris's and Jalinda's quests above take 8 turn-ins off; each Dun Morogh hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off. Outside Dun Morogh Gnomeregan pays little: Gaxim Rustfizzle's quests in Stonetalon (about 500) and Tinker Town's Gnomeregan dungeon quests. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your Runecloth at once.",
		},
		zone = 1455,
		zoneName = "Ironforge",
	}
end)

